<h2>Material Quality — What Is Actually Being Used</h2>
<p>One of the most persistent misconceptions in the carpenter vs modular debate is that carpenter kitchens use better materials. In practice, material selection in a carpenter kitchen is largely unmonitored — and the boards actually used on site are frequently not what was quoted or discussed.</p>
